.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.ATF.MK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.atf.mk
.Nd where ATF is found
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Finds the ATF test libraries:
in the prefix of the Kyua that runs the tests, under
.Pa /usr/local ,
and on
.Xr pkg-config 1 Ns 's
own path.
A test module stops, saying what was looked for, if there is none.
.Pp
Not included directly by a makefile.
.Pp
Native Windows output has no installed ATF, and always uses the one Bmake It
carries; see
.Xr mk.atfbmk.mk 5 .
.Ss Variables
.Bl -tag -width "BMK_ATF"
.It Va BMK_ATF
.Cm installed ,
the default: the system's.
.Cm bundled :
the one Bmake It carries.
.It Va KYUA
The Kyua to run, and where to look beside.
Default
.Pa kyua .
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "PKG_CONFIG_PATH"
.It Ev PKG_CONFIG_PATH
Also searched.
.El
.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -diag
.It BMK_ATF= Ns Ar value : expected bundled or installed
A bad value.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr kyua 1 ,
.Xr pkg-config 1 ,
.Xr mk.atfbmk.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.test.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.tst.mk 5 ,
.Xr bmake-it 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
